"So in January, the first day of the office arrived," I say.
"I went to the office by bus," I explain.
"I entered the software company."
"There I opened my new laptop."
"I saw the code there."
"But in the beginning, I did not know anything!"
Amit laughs and drinks his chai.
"Then what did you do?" he asks.
"Then I met my colleague Rohan," I answer.
"He helped me a lot."
"He explained everything to me."
"So my first day went well."
Neha looks at me with affection.
"You found a good friend right at the start," she says.
Sanjay also nods his head.
"This is a good story, Maya," Sanjay says.
I happily finish my chai.
I am very happy with these new friends.
